  m_Name: VO_Tutorial_Phase4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Phase 4
  beats:
  - beatId: E1
    settings:
      narrationDelay: 0
      durationMode: 0
      tailSeconds: 0.5
      hintTiming: 1
      hintCue: 
      nudgeDelay: 0
      nudgeRepeatSeconds: 12
      nudgeRepeats: 2
      waitForNarration: 1
    lines:
    - id: E1
      role: 0
      takes:
      - language: en
        variant: A
        text: The gas ahead is not scattered at random. Something you cannot see
          is pulling it into place.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f19cc20158aa12f4a892f08c99c23994, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 0
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: B
        text: The gas ahead is hydrogen, spread thin across the young universe. Something
          you cannot see is about to shape it.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5217940df5197124a8acbc3c80961a90, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 9
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: 
        text: 
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f19cc20158aa12f4a892f08c99c23994, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 0
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      cues: []
  - beatId: E2
    settings:
      narrationDelay: 0
      durationMode: 0
      tailSeconds: 0.5
      hintTiming: 1
      hintCue: 
      nudgeDelay: 0
      nudgeRepeatSeconds: 12
      nudgeRepeats: 2
      waitForNarration: 1
    lines:
    - id: E2_Before
      role: 0
      takes:
      - language: en
        variant: A
        text: 'This is what holds it together: dark matter. We cannot see it, but
          we can measure its pull.'
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 796853991f51ab44f9853a032af1d823, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 8
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: B
        text: On its own, the gas stays scattered, with nothing to hold it together.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48c000a9be369b945b66b9cfe009b8ba, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 6
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      cues: []
    - id: E2_After
      role: 2
      takes:
      - language: en
        variant: A
        text: Without dark matter, the gas drifts apart. Its gravity is what pulls
          gas into this structure.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 678a53005e6110c429f3b8e522cba9c9, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 7
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: B
        text: 'That is dark matter. Its gravity pulls the gas into this structure:
          long filaments, with empty voids between them.'
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7629b32befff9ed49816d08b3c3ca84b, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 8.5
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      cues: []
    - id: N_E2
      role: 1
      takes:
      - language: en
        variant: A
        text: Press B to switch dark matter off.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b37ac531668e05448b71ad5467d7bad7, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 2.5
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: B
        text: Press B to switch dark matter on.
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9424c6929d182da459c941db4f4768af, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 2.5
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      - language: en
        variant: 
        text: 
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b37ac531668e05448b71ad5467d7bad7, type: 3}
        estimatedSeconds: 0
        status: 1
        recordedText: 
      cues: []
  - beatId: E3
    settings:
      narrationDelay: 0
      durationMode: 0
      tailSeconds: 0.5
      hintTiming: 1
      hintCue: 
      nudgeDelay: 0
      nudgeRepeatSeconds: 12
